---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Glowcard from '~/components/glowcard.astro';

import '~/assets/styles/glow.css';
import '~/assets/styles/tailwind.css';

// Als je SVG in src/assets zit, is dit de nette Astro manier:
import lucienSvg from '~/assets/lucien.svg';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- 🌟 Story Sectie -->
  <section id="story" class="pt-10">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <!-- Intro -->
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-3">
          <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-mona bg-[length:200%_200%] animate-gradient-move">
            The Story
          </span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium opacity-90">
          Every great project starts with an idea. Here's the journey of The Mona.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cards -->
      <div class="grid gap-6">
        <!-- Inspiration -->
        <Glowcard>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Inspiration</h3>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            This project was born out of a love for creativity, technology, and the joy of bringing people together.
            The initial spark for The Mona came when we encountered “Odil de Krokodil,” a concept that quickly became
            a beloved part of our friend group. Inspired by the positive reception, we created our own version,
            “Lucien,” which was met with even more enthusiasm.
          </p>

          <img
            src={lucienSvg}
            alt="Lucien"
            class="mt-5 w-full max-w-sm mx-auto opacity-95"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </Glowcard>

        <!-- Why The Mona -->
        <Glowcard>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Why “The Mona”?</h3>

          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90 mb-4">
            When searching for a name, I wanted something that reflected a meaningful source of joy and inspiration in my life.
            The Mona carries the memory of someone who, in ways she may never fully realize, reignited a light in me I thought was lost.
            She reminded me of the quiet beauty in small moments and the strength in simply feeling alive again.
          </p>

          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            This project captures the essence of those feelings, transforming a fleeting connection into a creative expression of gratitude and hope.
            While our paths may never truly align, the impact lingers. The Mona is my tribute to that experience — a way to hold onto the positivity
            it brought into my life and to share it with others in a way that continues to inspire and create lasting moments together.
          </p>
        </Glowcard>

        <!-- (OPTIONEEL) Extra card: Journey / Today -->
        <Glowcard>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">From idea to moments</h3>
          <p class="text-base leading-relaxed opacity-90">
            The Mona is built to be shared: simple, playful, and a little chaotic in the best way.
            A project that turns a small spark into something people can experience together — and hopefully laugh about later.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a
              href="/demo"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-mona-alt text-white hover:opacity-90 transition bg-[length:200%_200%] animate-gradient-move"
            >
              Try the demo
            </a>
            <a
              href="/#features"
              class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/20 hover:bg-white/5 transition"
            >
              See features
            </a>
          </div>
        </Glowcard>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
